  "summary": "Malicious code in vl-ui-demo (npm)",
  "details": "Vl-ui-demo@1.0.0 is an empty placeholder package (a comment-only index.js, no lifecycle hooks, no dependencies, no executable code) published under the vl-ui-* name family, which impersonates the vl-ui design-system library namespace. The package ships no functional payload; its significance is the combosquat name and the namespace-squatting pattern. No network endpoints, credentials, or files are involved in this version.",
